**🧧 Supported Versions:**
- 1.21.10
- 1.21.11 *[LTS]*
- 26.1 *[LTS]*
- 26.1.1 & 26.1.2
- 26.2
- 26.3-pre-3 *[TS]*

**🔌 Supported ModLoaders:**
- Fabric
- Quilt
- NeoForge
- Sponge
- Paper

