- [SWM] Pause Screen (buttons)
- Stupid Either fix
- [Client Command] Suggest Event
- [Documentation] ModLoader annotations
- [Documentation] Fog
- [Documentation] `@ModifyScreen`
- [Screen Modifier API] #widget([WidgetMarker] marker)
