- [Screen API] #is([Identification] id)
- [ModLoader] Library Downloading
- [Client] #getFont()
- [Screen API] #{ width, height }()
- [Screen API] Drawer#drawCenteredString(...) shadow variants
- [Documentation] Drawer# methods
- [Render Layer API] Potential fixes for non-Minecraft-dependent projects
- [ModLoader] [@KeyHandler] #ingame() [default = true]
- [Screen API] Widget rendering on custom screens
- [Screen API] Drawer#renderOutline(...) with renderlayer variant
- [Render Layer API] Creation API
- [Screen Modifier API] Mark the injection methods as override-only
- [Screen Modifier API] Make double invoking force-call the target method
- [ModLoader] Mod Before Load Event
- [Entity API] Static view state functions

